recipes (`j3c doc recipes <name>`):

    app2d     a window, a game loop, keys, and 2D drawing
    scene3d   load an editor scene, run its scripts, and draw it lit and shadowed
    canvas    draw a sprite in code and save it as a PNG, no window
    paint     batched 2D shapes, text, clip, and transforms with j3.gfx.paint
    audio     a PCM output stream: a sine tone queued per frame, playhead from queued()
    display   a Video settings page: window mode, resolution, monitor, vsync, frame cap, saved
    hotkey    a global hotkey: F8 toggles pause while another app has focus (Linux X11)
    watch     notice files changed outside the app (a folder and a file)
    paste     Ctrl+V pastes an image, GIF, or file list from the clipboard (clipboardTypes/clipboardData)
    dragout   drag a file out of the window into Discord, a browser, or a file manager (dragFiles, Linux X11)
    components a `.j3ui` window: a component with a canvas and a button, styled with CSS
    ansi      colored process or build output in a `.j3ui` pane: AnsiLog turns escapes into styled spans
    tui       a full-screen terminal program: Screen.open, draw a box and text, poll keys, q quits
    pty       run `ls --color=always` in a pty, read until eof, feed a Grid, print the screen as text
    script    a `.j3s` script with props, shared and per-instance state, made from J3
    j2        load a j2 mod at runtime: bind a native, call its fn, read a field, show an error
    meshgen   build a mesh in code for an editor project
    threads   build chunks on a worker pool and accept only current results, no window
    config    read settings.toml with defaults, change a value, save it back (j3.data.toml)
    http      call a web API on a worker thread: JSON body, https, reply read on the frame loop
    timeout   run a command with a timeout and kill its whole tree: process group, log file, rlimits
    material  a `.j3mat` material with a `.j3fx` shader effect
    urp       traced mirrors, glass, and sun shadows
    check     the edit, check, look, play loop and what each step catches

Each prints the files of a whole program; write them into an empty directory and run `j3c check`.
